This directory contains code adapted from two upstream Apache License 2.0
projects, not written from scratch for AEInpaintPlugin:

- open-mmlab/PowerPaint
  https://github.com/open-mmlab/PowerPaint
  Source of: pp_utils.py, utils.py, loaders.py, and the overall PowerPaint
  task-token / dual-prompt approach used by pipeline_powerpaint_brushnet.py.

- TencentARC/BrushNet
  https://github.com/TencentARC/BrushNet
  Source of: brushnet.py (BrushNetModel), and the BrushNet-specific parts of
  pipeline_powerpaint_brushnet.py.

- unet_2d_blocks.py and unet_2d_condition.py are adapted from internal
  diffusers modules (huggingface/diffusers, also Apache 2.0), pinned to a
  specific diffusers version's internal APIs to support BrushNet's
  conditioning hooks. These are NOT the public diffusers API and will not
  automatically track upstream diffusers releases — see the warning in
  server/requirements.txt.

Per the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory), this NOTICE file
must be preserved and included in redistributions of this code.

No modifications beyond what's needed to integrate with this project's
engine interface (server/engines/base.py) are intended, but this code has
not been diffed line-by-line against the current upstream repositories to
confirm that — treat it as a frozen vendor snapshot, not a maintained fork.
